    "detailed_description": "Before purchasing, you can understand the basic gameplay and overall quality of the game through the page introduction, video, and pictures.<br>This game is independently developed, you can report bugs encountered in the game in the following ways:<br>Steam Community Forum<br><br><u>Game introduction</u><br>You will play as a businessman, running a grocery store, make money through retail and other methods, and then continue to grow and develop with the goal of becoming the first chamber of commerce on this continent<br><br><u>Basic gameplay</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Selling goods: By signing contracts with suppliers, purchasing goods, and then selling them to various customers to earn the difference.<br></li><li>Place facilities: By building various facilities and rooms, attract customers to spend and increase income.<br></li><li>Adventure collection: Go on adventures on various maps, collect raw materials, and obtain special items.<br></li><li>Build production: By building various commodities by yourself, you can reduce dependence on suppliers and gain greater profits.<br></li><li>Pet cultivation: Adventurers can capture all kinds of monsters and bring them back for cultivation. As a partner of adventurers, they can increase their combat power.</li></ul>",
